# Instance-specific hardware captures — never commit.
# The live enclave returns its own EK cert / report dynamically
# (report field `google_ak_cert_pem`), so a checked-in copy has zero
# verifier utility and only hands adversaries legitimate certificates
# to replay in verifier bypasses.
/google_ak*
/debug_full.json
/report*.json
node_modules/

# Agent-tooling session marker (internal UUID — audit SEC-07: never track)
.freebuff/
